          "at": "2026-11-14T10:08:17.660Z",
          "html": "<p>Done:  a tag with a quoted name, chosen from the suggestions, is now written <code>&lt;action \"|\" /&gt;</code>, with a space after the end quote (Spanish <code>&lt;acción \"|\" /&gt;</code>), and the hover help shows it that way too.</p>\n<p>Tags with no name stay <code>&lt;divider/&gt;</code>, as most of the examples write them.  Say if you want those spaced too.</p>"
        }
